Not distributed
===============

Other vendors' software that the tests run (for example Universal Robots' URSim, Doosan's DRCF,
AUBO's ARCS, KUKA's RSI simulator, OnRobot's client library) is downloaded when a test needs it,
into a container or a temporary directory, under that vendor's own terms. None of it is copied into
this repository or into a Skynet OS release.

The Rust code in this repository uses no outside crates.
